const INITIAL_KNOWLEDGE = `The Notes from December 10, 2025, consolidate information spanning artificial intelligence advancements, government funding policies, and holistic health concepts, particularly focusing on the intersection of AI with Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) diagnostics.

1. Advancements in AI-Driven Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM)
The notes highlight the development of systems aimed at bridging traditional, often subjective, diagnostic practices with objective, quantifiable data using sophisticated AI techniques.
• Multimodal Diagnostics: AI systems like the TCM Constitution Assessment System (TCM-CAS) aim to automate the assessment task by processing multimodal clinical inputs,. This involves combining visual data (from face and tongue images) with subjective patient information (from questionnaires),,.
